== Description ==

A versioned library of AI-agent instructions for iDempiere plugins, environments and core contributions. It is not an OSGi plugin. The local catalog contains 78 entries and 33 distinct names.

== Versioned workflows ==

The same 15 names exist under each target line: 8, 10, 12 and 13. Select the actual release and never load competing copies of one name.

